14:- A footnote goes in the footer of `CardSection` and never in an empty trailing section. A trailing section built
21:- `CardSection`: the default section of a card screen, with an optional label above and a left-aligned footnote below. Do not build a `Section` with its own card background, header style and footer inset.
22:- `FooterBlockSection`: a card section whose footer is a centred block of any views that scrolls with the list, such as the About block. Do not hand-build a footer for it, and use `CardSection` when the footer is only left-aligned text.
23:- `SectionLabel`: the header style of a section label. `CardSection` applies it already, so use it by hand only on a `Section` you build yourself, and never set a header's case and insets yourself.
79:- `footnoteGap`: the gap between a card and its footnote, applied by `CardSection`. Do not pad a footnote yourself.
